          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 29.12,
          "relative_start": 17.04,
          "relative_end": 29.12,
          "en": "But set the table for us for this NATO summit scheduled to start on Tuesday. And I look at what the goals are as set out by NATO, defense investment, defense industry and support for Ukraine. What can we expect when that summit gets underway in Turkey?",
